# Personal multi-agent rig tooling (see .rig-launcher/README.md). The
# launcher script and every *-rig/ project spec ARE tracked — they're
# authored config/code, portable across machines by design (no absolute
# paths; cwd is always supplied via --cwd at launch). Only genuinely
# machine-specific or secret state is excluded below.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Runtime-generated per-seat state (sidecars, persisted chat history,
# AGENTS.md) — mechanically regenerated from the tracked agent.yaml/role.md
# on every launch, never authored by hand. Scoped to these specific generated
# paths (not the whole workspace/ directory) so authored config living
# alongside them — srt-config.json, the seat's sandbox policy — stays
# tracked. The .openrig/ exceptions below are required: the generic
# `.openrig/` ignore above (matches at any depth) would otherwise exclude
# this nested directory wholesale, and git cannot re-include a file under an
# excluded parent — the parent itself must be negated first.
!.ollama-pilot/workspace/.openrig/
!.ollama-pilot/workspace/.openrig/ollama/
.ollama-pilot/workspace/.openrig/ollama/history.json
.ollama-pilot/workspace/.openrig/ollama/state.json
.ollama-pilot/workspace/AGENTS.md
# Memory system's actual chunk store (real conversation content, grows over
# time) — unlike srt-config.json and memory-config.json above/below, this one
# must stay gitignored even though it lives under the negated .openrig/
# parent. Path confirmed against plugin.ts's actual MemoryStore filePath
# (<cwd>/.openrig/ollama/memory/chunks.jsonl).
.ollama-pilot/workspace/.openrig/ollama/memory/

# This machine's own project registry — real absolute paths, regenerated
# automatically (seeded fresh) by launcher.py if absent.
.rigs-registry.json
# Real API key VALUES. Never commit this. See .rig-launcher/README.md.
.rigs-secrets.env

# Local demo proof artifacts
demo/proof/

# Build artifacts
*.tgz

# OPR.0.5.3.7 R2 — the shipped context-pack projection is DERIVED AT PACKAGE TIME
# (scripts/generate-context-packs.mjs), never committed or edited in place.
packages/daemon/context-packs/

# Internal build receipts; never commit
/.evidence/
